# The security gate must not be editable by the PR it judges: required
# checks run the workflow version from the PR branch, so changes to the
# gate itself, its suppression files, and the update policy need an
# explicit owner review before merge.
/.github/                                @Yassimba
**/osv-scanner.toml                      @Yassimba
/skills/**/.skillspector-baseline.yaml   @Yassimba
/renovate.json                           @Yassimba
